//Boss Kills
MushroomMonarchKilled: {
	FriendlyName: Big Fungus
	Description: Overthrow the Mushroom Monarch, a fungal abomination whose title is self-imposed.
}

FeudalFungusKilled: {
	FriendlyName: Glowing Feud
	Description: Strike down the Feudal Fungus, a fungal abomination with a mean streak.
}

GripsOfChaosKilled: {
	FriendlyName: Out of Hands
	Description: Defeat the Grips of Chaos, disastrous beings with five fingers and a thirst for chaos.
}

TruffleToadKilled: {
	FriendlyName: There She Croaked
	Description: Take down the Truffle Toad, a surprisingly agile fungal beast.
}

BroodmotherKilled: {
	FriendlyName: Ashes to Ashes
	Description: Defeat the The Broodmother, a dragon born of molten fury.
}

HydraKilled: {
	FriendlyName: Three Heads Think Better Than One
	Description: Decapitate the Hydra, a wrathful beast that dwells in the Mire.
}

DesertDjinnKilled: {
	FriendlyName: No Wishes?
	Description: Outflex the the Desert Djinn, a muscular genie who roams the sandy wastes.
}

SubzeroSerpentKilled: {
	FriendlyName: Below Zero
	Description: Defrost the Subzero Serpent, a glistening snake that lives in the frigid tundra.
}

SagittariusKilled: {
	FriendlyName: Feeling Hoarse
	Description: Destroy Sagittarius, a machine-turned-trojan by the dark will of the Void.
}

AkumaKilled: {
	FriendlyName: How To Slay A Dragon
	Description: Reduce Akuma, the Draconian Demon into nothing but ash.
}

AnubisKilled: {
	FriendlyName: Your First Step
	Description: Best the legendscribe Anubis in a friendly spar.
}

BiomiteCoreKilled: {
	FriendlyName: Core of the World
	Description: Endure the Biomite Core, the Keep's defense and training mechanism.
}

AthenaKilled: {
	FriendlyName: Divine Discipline
	Description: Defeat the shrewd Seraph Queen, Athena.
}

ChampionRajahKilled: {
	FriendlyName: Who Framed Rajah Rabbit?
	Description: Make peace with the Pouncing Punisher himself and inherit his title of 'Champion of the Innocent'.
}

EquinoxWormsKilled: {
	FriendlyName: See You Next Year!
	Description: Pass the Equinox Worms' trial, earning their blessing.
}

GreedKilled: {
	FriendlyName: Non-Fungible Totem
	Description: Defeat the avaricious Greed and make his Hoard your own.
}

InfinityZeroKilled: {
	FriendlyName: Fatal Error
	Description: Obliterate Infinity Zero, leaving none of Oblivion's toys unscathed.
}

PreEquinoxAncientsKilled: {
	FriendlyName: The Awakening
	Description: Defeat Anubis, Athena and Greed at their strongest.
}

RajahKilled: {
	FriendlyName: Rabbit Season
	Description: Confront Rajah Rabbit and live to tell the tale.
}

ShenDoragonKilled: {
	FriendlyName: Through the Mire and the Flames
	Description: Decimate Shen Doragon, putting an end to his eternal chaos.
}

SiegeMechsKilled: {
	FriendlyName: Warheap Arsenal
	Description: Defeat the three nocturnal fulgarian menaces: the Retriever, Ortrus X, and Raider Ultima.
}

SistersOfDiscordKilled: {
	FriendlyName: Discordian Intervention
	Description: Send the Sisters of Discord crying back to their papas.
}

SoulOfCthulhuKilled: {
	FriendlyName: Shipwrecked
	Description: Exorcise the Soul of Cthulhu, preventing its cosmic calamity from enveloping the world.
}

StormingSiege: {
	FriendlyName: Geargrind Assault
	Description: Do battle against the Retriever, Orthrus X, and Raider Ultima simultaneously and emerge victorious.
}

TechnoTruffleKilled: {
	FriendlyName: The Fourth Metal Ingredient
	Description: Destroy the fulgarian fungal mistake, Techno Truffle
}

YamataKilled: {
	FriendlyName: Talking Heads
	Description: Sever the many heads of Yamata, the Dread Nightmare.
}

ZeroKilled: {
	FriendlyName: System.DivideByZeroException
	Description: Decommision the Void's primary Zero Unit, and earn the ire of a far greater threat...
}

AllBossesKilled: {
	FriendlyName: Who's Awakening Now?
	Description: Defeat every boss in Ancients Awakened: Classic.
}

//Ores Mined
ChaosOreMined: {
	FriendlyName: Chaos Control
	Description: Mine Incinerite or Abyssium, chaotic ore found deep underground.
}

CelestialOreMined: {
	FriendlyName: Quintessence
	Description: Mine Radium or Darkmatter, cosmic ore formed in deep space.
}

TierThreeChaosOreMined: {
	FriendlyName: Antediluvian
	Description: Mine Daybreak Incinerite or Eventide Abyssium, primeval forms of previous ore found within the Inferno and Mire respectively.
}

ApocalyptiteOreMined: {
	FriendlyName: Apocalypse Now
	Description: Mine Apocalyptite, an unstable ore formed by the destructive energies of the Void.
}

//Items Obtained
LuckyArmorEquipped: {
	FriendlyName: Yu-Farm-Lot
	Description: Equip a full set of the Stripeman's Lucky armor, allowing you to mine, fish and farm like no other.
}

MadnessPotionCrafted: {
	FriendlyName: Forbidden Alchemy
	Description: Trade a Madness Mushroom with the Mushman for some Rainbow mushroom, and craft a potion with them.
}

ChaosCrafted: {
	FriendlyName: Nemesis
	Description: Obtain Chaos, forged from the finest blades of fury and wrath.
}

TerratoolCrafted: {
	FriendlyName: Omni-Tool
	Description: Obtain a Terratool, and wield a pickaxe, axe, and hammer all in a single tool.
}

DragonstrideBootsCrafted: {
	FriendlyName: Boots of the Dragon
	Description: Craft the Dragonstride Boots, and dash across the world with draconic speed!
}

TimecallerCrafted: {
	FriendlyName: Time Lord
	Description: Craft the Timecaller, allowing you to bend time as you please.
}

EXSoulCrafted: {
	FriendlyName: Going to the Extreme
	Description: Upgrade a weapon with an EX Soul. Now you're cooking with gas!
}

InfinityCoreCrafted: {
	FriendlyName: Divinity's Forge
	Description: Complete the Infinity Core, the ultimate crafting station.
}

//Discovery
RedMushroomDiscovered: {
	FriendlyName: Groovy Grotto
	Description: Encounter a Red Mushroom biome, or make one yourself with some Spore Bags.
}

TerrariumDiscovered: {
	FriendlyName: Heart of Nature
	Description: Discover the Terrarium, a crystaline globe radiating with natural energies.
}

VoidDiscovered: {
	FriendlyName: Inanis
	Description: Discover the Void, an ominous cluster of islands hanging in low orbit.
}

MushmanEncountered: {
	FriendlyName: Now there are two of them!
	Description: Build a house in the Red Mushroom biome and have the Mushman move in.
}

AcropolisDiscovered: {
	FriendlyName: Mount Olympus
	Description: Discover the Acropolis, home of the Seraph Queen and her kin.
}

HoardDiscovered: {
	FriendlyName: Hoarding: Buried Alive
	Description: Discover the Cavern of the Worm King, a hoard filled with stolen treasures.
}

GreedChestOpened: {
	FriendlyName: Kleptomaniac
	Description: Swipe a key from the Hoard's Scavengers, and unlock one of their King's precious chests.
}

EquinoxAltarDiscovered: {
	FriendlyName: Equilibrium
	Description: Find the Equinox Altar high above the clouds.
}

AllBiomesDiscovered: {
	FriendlyName: Around the World
	Description: Discover each of the biomes and structures in Ancients Awakened: Classic.
}
